# Files that run inside Linux containers or are mounted into them must keep
# LF on every checkout. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which
# turned scripts/backup/pgurl.sh into CRLF on the owner's laptop; busybox sh
# then fails on every line (measured 2026-09-23).
*.sh               text eol=lf
scripts/backup/**  text eol=lf
